{"metadata":{"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"title":[{"Plain":"平坦环同态"},2],"slug":[{"Plain":"平坦环同态"},0],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>称环同态 $A\\to B$ 是<strong>平坦</strong>的是指\n$$\r\n{-}\\otimes B\\colon B\\mathsf {Mod}\\to A\\mathsf {Mod}\r\n$$\n正合. 此时我们也称 $B$ 在 $A$ 上平坦 (flat over $A$).</p>\n<h2>相关概念</h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"平坦概形态射","text":"平坦概形态射"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"忠实平坦环同态","text":null}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}